            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>1. Just write. My technique is simply to open a Word document and start writing: do not stop, do not pass go, do not collect £100. Just write. Turn off autocorrect if you have to. This will get your creative juices flowing without fear of making spelling mistakes or worrying about grammar and punctuation. This is a useful technique because it gives you a hard copy of the thoughts whirling around your head.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
